      "steps": ["$\\sqrt{a_{n-1}+1}^{\\,2} = a_{n-1} + 1$ since $a_{n-1} + 1 \\ge 0$.", "So the sequence increases by 1 each step: $a_{500} = 20 + 500 = 520$."]
    },
